OL,3,AIndia's opposition set to hold mega
OL,4,Arally seeking election chief's
OL,5,Aresignation
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fexpected to gather in the Indian
OL,9,Fcapital, Delhi, for a mega opposition
OL,10,Frally, seeking the resignation of chief
OL,11,Felection commissioner and electoral
OL,12,Freforms.
OL,14,FThe rally, called by the main
OL,15,Fopposition Congress party, will begin
OL,16,Faround noon at the famous Ramlila
OL,17,FMaidan grounds, with leaders claiming a
OL,18,Fmillion people could attend.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
